From e600ef77a94ac8bcb2f3b9c53a3462b3ba297e95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: loothero <loothero@provable.games>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 08:28:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] add sound page animation_url to token_uri

Optional sound page contract (owner-set, zero = unchanged token_uri). When
set, token_uri hands the JSON members and SVG base64 to the page together with
this collection's address and the token ID; the page's MIDI provider reads the
Beast's live state from this contract's getters and returns the full token_uri
with an animation_url that plays the Beast's music.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
